OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to increase capacity at
OL,4,Acemetery approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to increase capacity at a
OL,7,Fcemetery in Melton Mowbray have been
OL,8,Fgiven the go-ahead.
OL,10,FMelton Borough Council's cabinet has
OL,11,Fapproved plans to increase capacity at
OL,12,FThorpe Road Cemetery by removing a
OL,13,Fnumber of smaller footpaths to create
OL,14,Fadditional burial and cremation plots.
OL,16,FAccording to the Conservative-run
OL,17,Fcouncil, due to the age of the
OL,18,Fcemetery, space was "limited" and it
OL,19,Fcontinued "to reduce year on year".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
